{"lines": ["A US colonel put it in writing: a glowing triangle landed in a British forest.", "December 1980. Airmen at RAF Woodbridge see lights drop into Rendlesham Forest.", "They walk in. A metallic triangle, pulsing red and blue, slips away. Farm animals go into a frenzy.", "At dawn: three dents in the ground, right where it stood.", "Two nights later, Colonel Charles Halt goes in, tape recording. His team scans the dents for radiation. Then a red light breaks into five.", "He reports it to Britain's Ministry of Defence. Radar shows nothing. Verdict: no defence significance.", "And that's not the strangest part. Skeptics blame a fireball, a lighthouse, and rabbit holes.", "The memo is real, and sits in the National Archives. Alien craft, or ordinary lights? Comment CRAFT or LIGHTS."], "words": [["A", 0.0, 0.08], ["US", 0.08, 0.56], ["colonel", 0.94, 0.98], ["put", 0.98, 1.36], ["it", 1.36, 1.48], ["in", 1.48, 1.64], ["writing:", 1.64, 1.9], ["a", 2.46, 2.52], ["glowing", 2.52, 2.82], ["triangle", 2.82, 3.4], ["landed", 3.4, 4.0], ["in", 4.0, 4.34], ["a", 4.34, 4.4], ["British", 4.4, 4.58], ["forest.", 4.58, 5.04], ["December", 5.84, 6.16], ["1980.", 6.16, 7.26], ["Airmen", 8.18, 8.66], ["at", 8.66, 9.0], ["RAF", 9.0, 9.38], ["Woodbridge", 9.38, 10.34], ["see", 10.34, 10.66], ["lights", 10.66, 10.96], ["drop", 10.96, 11.34], ["into", 11.34, 11.7], ["Rendlesham", 11.7, 12.36], ["Forest.", 12.36, 12.82], ["They", 13.569, 13.7], ["walk", 13.7, 13.96], ["in.", 13.96, 14.28], ["A", 14.28, 14.62], ["metallic", 14.62, 14.9], ["triangle,", 14.9, 15.52], ["pulsing", 15.52, 16.44], ["red", 16.44, 16.66], ["and", 16.66, 16.98], ["blue,", 16.98, 17.24], ["slips", 17.24, 17.62], ["away.", 17.62, 18.14], ["Farm", 18.66, 18.86], ["animals", 18.86, 19.36], ["go", 19.36, 19.7], ["into", 19.7, 19.96], ["a", 19.96, 20.1], ["frenzy.", 20.1, 20.34], ["At", 21.142, 21.22], ["dawn:", 21.22, 21.46], ["three", 21.8, 22.0], ["dents", 22.0, 22.34], ["in", 22.34, 22.44], ["the", 22.44, 22.5